(
    title: "Astroblast",
    description: Some("A fast fixed shooter, the home version of Mattel\'s Intellivision game Astrosmash. A laser base slides along the bottom of the screen and you blast a constant rain of falling objects — meteors of various sizes that split into smaller ones when hit, plus faster hazards — racking up points while never letting them reach you or the ground. The pace ramps up relentlessly the longer you survive."),
